# What a Vercel deploy may upload. An allowlist, so anything new in this
# folder is private by default.
#
# Only the dashboard goes to Vercel. The engine and its database, logs and run
# state, the confidential vendor documentation, reports and every local secret
# stay on this machine. Without this file the CLI uploads the whole folder --
# and did, until 25 Sep 2026.
/*
!/web
!/vercel.json

# Inside the dashboard: test scripts, screenshots and runtime state are not
# part of the site.
/web/screenshots
/web/screenshots-live
/web/data/live*.json
/web/verify*.py
/web/check_tables.py
/web/*.tsbuildinfo
